  _dialogueLines:
  - "So you\u2019re the ninja everyone\u2019s talking about. Saw the mask you\u2019re
    wearing\u2026 strange make. Very old."
  - "Not exactly. But when I touched it\u2026 it whispered. Cold as ice. Your mask
    ain\u2019t normal."
  - "Something like: return\u2026 return\u2026 Gave me chills."
  - Not without a Nightsteel Fragment.
  - "The Abandoned Shrine. But be careful \u2014 the air there moves like it's alive."
  - Thanks.
